update comment, per Pratyush

Link: https://lkml.kernel.org/r/aW_Mqp6HcqLwQImS@kernel.org
Signed-off-by: Mike Rapoport (Microsoft) <rppt@kernel.org>
Cc: Pasha Tatashin <pasha.tatashin@soleen.com>
